    "https://jobs.purchase.edu/postings/1711": {
      "title": "Assistant Coach, Women's Volleyball",
      "description": "Purchase College Portal | Assistant Coach, Women&#39;s Volleyball Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Assistant Coach, Women's Volleyball Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Posting Details Posting Number S432P Job Title Assistant Coach, Women's Volleyball Application Deadline 10/15/2026 Department Physical Education & Athletics FT - PT Part Time Part-time % Minimum Salary $4,500 Maximum Salary $4,500 Description This is a part-time position, and the assistant coach will be responsible for assisting with the development, coaching, organization, and management of the women’s volleyball team. Duties will include assisting with recruiting, game management, budget, equipment management, promotional activities, fund-raising, player eligibility, and NCAA Division III rules compliance. Purchase College is a member of the Skyline Conference and a member of Division III . Qualifications Required: Bachelor’s Degree in Physical Education or related field. Previous successful coaching experience at the high school or college level, excellent interpersonal and communications skills, recruiting experience, and knowledge of NCAA Division III rules and regulations as well as a valid driver’s license is required. Special Note Date to be Filled Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Applicant Documents Required Documents Resume Cover Letter Optional Documents Purchase College, SUNY 735 Anderson Hill Road, Purchase, NY 10577 © Purchase College, SUNY To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
